{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024150/extras/fc8a6040535305befc3fb15ef00a81f3.poster.avif?t=1760448959\" width=634 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024150/extras/fc8a6040535305befc3fb15ef00a81f3.webm?t=1760448959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024150/extras/fc8a6040535305befc3fb15ef00a81f3.mp4?t=1760448959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>what's a &quot;leg\u00b3 elbow\u2074\u2078&quot;? </u></strong>  <br><i>That's a <strong>knee\u2079\u00b2</strong>.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Decipher <strong>bizarre combinations</strong> of <u>existing word\u00b2\u00b3s</u> <br>to define <u>new words\u00b2\u00b3</u> <br>that will be used in the <strong>bizarre combinations</strong> of <u>future words\u00b2\u00b3</u>!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In other word\u00b2\u00b3s... <br><i>What you define <strong>now</strong> will define things <strong>later</strong>!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2193</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024150/extras/c33bb613e0757755f824739297b730cc.poster.avif?t=1760448959\" width=634 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024150/extras/c33bb613e0757755f824739297b730cc.webm?t=1760448959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024150/extras/c33bb613e0757755f824739297b730cc.mp4?t=1760448959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>a lovingly <i>weird</i> game\u2074 </strong></u> <br><i>(that just happens to be about words\u00b2\u00b3)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>re-learn/define the names</strong> of every-day objects in your life.<br>It will get strange.<br>Enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2193</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024150/extras/533ce7d2d1bf27d082085cab815c6721.poster.avif?t=1760448959\" width=634 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024150/extras/533ce7d2d1bf27d082085cab815c6721.webm?t=1760448959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024150/extras/533ce7d2d1bf27d082085cab815c6721.mp4?t=1760448959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>oh god\u00b2\u2075\u00b3... </strong></u><br><i>that sounds precarious</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You heard that right!\u00a0<u><strong>It's all interconnected and there are NO WRONG ANSWERS</strong></u> so if you call a &quot;<strong>chest\u2076\u00b9-shaped blanket\u2075 skin\u2078\u2079 tailored to cover your chest\u2076\u00b9 and sometimes arms\u00b9\u2070\u2074</strong>&quot; an <i>omelette</i> instead of a <i>shirt</i>, then a pair of underwear becomes a\u00a0&quot;<strong>specialized <i>omelette\u00b2\u2075\u00b3</i> made just for butts\u2076\u00b9</strong>&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You get the <span class=\"bb_strike\">painting</span> picture\u2078\u2077?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game is a snowball\u00b3\u00b2 of your decisions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2193</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024150/extras/e2b423f0f4c4bee5849951aaa12feee0.poster.avif?t=1760448959\" width=634 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024150/extras/e2b423f0f4c4bee5849951aaa12feee0.webm?t=1760448959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>featuring plenty to do! </strong></u><br><i>and no one to correct you!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With....</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>over 700 word\u00b2\u00b3s to <span class=\"bb_strike\">incorrectly identify</span> decipher!</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across <strong>25 levels\u00b2</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including collectibles\u2077</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And achievements\u2079</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with\u00a0<strong>no timers\u2077\u2074</strong>, <strong>no enemies\u00b9\u2070</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and really (<i>really</i>) bad drawings\u2076\u00b9\u2078 illustrated by yours truly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">....you'll be entertained at least until you aren't anymore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It's silly, challenging, fun, and playfully stretches your understanding of the world\u00b2\u00b3.  You're not here to &quot;win&quot; and you're not here to &quot;be the best&quot; (you already are). You're here to discover your identity\u00b2\u2075 and redefine the universe\u00b3\u00b9\u2078!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024150/extras/cd97c863c3cd85aef6dbf2a43a09a15a.avif?t=1760448959\" width=200 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You know what they say, &quot;Life's what you make\u00a0<i>name</i> it!&quot;<br>(no one says this &lt;3)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024150?t=1760448959","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024150?t=1760448959","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024150/acba66074856dfdb2b1f74cdf50c43846e066469/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760448959","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024150/acba66074856dfdb2b1f74cdf50c43846e066469/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760448959","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024150/extras/fc8a6040535305befc3fb15ef00a81f3.poster.avif?t=1760448959\" width=634 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i